-- Be Raptor (26775): the Burning Twig from the Gurubashi Brazier lasts 8 s instead of 6 (Four, 2026-11-20:
-- the run from the brazier to a tiki was very tight). Run against bfa_hotfixes.
--
-- Item 58250 Burning Twig: DurationInInventory 6 -> 8. Every other field is the client's own value
-- (read from ItemSparse, mapped to the 8.3.7 column layout). The server takes the item's expiry from
-- this row, and the hotfix tells the client the new duration.
--
-- hotfix_data: table hash 0x919BE54E (2442913102) is ItemSparse.db2; hotfix ids 95xxxxx (9500000 + item id).
-- Restart worldserver and delete the client Cache folder. Safe to run more than once.
DELETE FROM `item_sparse` WHERE `ID`=58250;
